WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.775
It is eleven forty-two on a Tuesday night.

2
00:00:04.775 --> 00:00:09.600
You are standing in the kitchen with the fridge open, and you aren't hungry.

3
00:00:10.575 --> 00:00:12.750
The light falls on your feet.

4
00:00:13.775 --> 00:00:18.200
Someone in the next room stopped talking to you, or you stopped first.

5
00:00:19.175 --> 00:00:21.200
You can't remember now.

6
00:00:22.175 --> 00:00:25.850
There are seven unread messages on your phone.

7
00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:29.450
You know who three of them are from.

8
00:00:30.425 --> 00:00:32.350
You take out the milk.

9
00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:35.325
You read the date on it.

10
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.825
You put it back.

11
00:00:38.825 --> 00:00:46.125
At eleven forty-four you close the door, and the kitchen goes dark, and you stay there a while longer.

12
00:00:47.075 --> 00:00:49.100
It is still Tuesday.
